# Frontend Feature Pattern

## Layout

```
src/frontend/src/
  app/           # App shell, routes only
  features/      # Domain modules (home, pets, adoption)
  shared/        # Cross-feature API client, hooks, UI primitives, types
  components/    # App shell layout (Header, Footer, Layout)
```

## Rules

- **Pages live in features**: `features/<name>/pages/*Page.tsx`
- **Feature API**: `features/<name>/api/` — thin wrappers over `@/shared/api/client`
- **Shared hooks**: `useAsyncResource` for load/error/retry (NFR-3.2)
- **No cross-feature imports of pages** — only hooks/utils/api from other features if needed
- **Pet status UI**: use `@/shared/lib/petStatus` + `PetStatusBadge`
- **Imports**: `@/` alias → `src/` (not repo root)

## Adding a feature

1. Create `features/<name>/` with `pages/`, optional `api/`, `hooks/`, `components/`
2. Register route in `app/routes.tsx`
3. Update SRS/user-flows if new screen behavior
